Yamamoto Aerospace is an airframe company and a competitor of [[Org/Hildebrandt Corporation/index|Hildebrandt Corporation]]. It held one of the twenty [[Phenomena/Keystone|keystones]], lost it when its compound was broken into some weeks before the pilgrimage, and hired mercenaries to take another from travelers on the road out of [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]]. The hired hands were poor and the attempt failed.
